"q\": \"All-ages rates were age-adjusted to the year 2000 U.S. standard.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"MSA-level data involving firearm homicide or suicide counts <20 are not reported separately because of concerns about statistical stability and data privacy.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Comparison statistics were recalculated for 2006–2007 to reflect revisions to MSA delineations and population estimates\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Rates are age-adjusted to the year 2000 U.S. standard population.\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"analytic_depth\"]}", "type": "text"}]}